#: spack.installer.base.StdinReader:4
msgid ""
"Raw bytes are read from the backing file descriptor or socket for stdin "
"(instead of the TextIOWrapper) to avoid double buffering issues: the event "
"loop triggers when the fd is ready to read, and if we do a partial read from "
